-- Flyway migration V2 -- account-service (CardDemo Feature F-003)
-- Seeds the `accounts` table with the 50 records migrated from the legacy fixed-length
-- flat file app/data/ASCII/acctdata.txt (50 records x 300 bytes). Depends on V1.
--
-- The legacy monetary fields are 12-char ZONED DECIMAL with a trailing overpunched sign
-- byte (USAGE DISPLAY, NOT COMP-3): 11 leading digits + a sign byte where {=+0, A-I=+1..9,
-- }=-0, J-R=-1..9; the low-order two digits are the cents (S9(10)V99). That decode was
-- performed at authoring time; the statements below are STATIC quoted literals only
-- (no dynamic SQL / no string concatenation) -- AAP 0.6.6.
--
-- Per-row facts verified against the source: active_status='Y', current_cycle_credit=0.00,
-- current_cycle_debit=0.00, address_zip='A000000000', group_id blank (10 spaces -> '' since
-- the column is NOT NULL), version=0 (initial optimistic-lock value). Account ids are the
-- zero-padded 11-char keys 00000000001..00000000050. Dates are already ISO yyyy-MM-dd.

